<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Water quality monitoring programme notice</title><link rel='stylesheet' href='/static/b.css'></head><body><header><section class='topbar' data-nav-v='1'><span>SIM-B</span> <a href='/'>feed</a> <a href='/about'>about</a></section></header><main><section class='entry' data-ref='B-2001'><h2>Water quality monitoring programme notice</h2><div class='meta'><div class='row'><span class='label'>Ref</span><span class='value'>B-2001</span></div><div class='row'><span class='label'>Issued</span><span class='value'>2026-03-11</span></div></div><div class='content'><p>The programme will sample 40 municipal sites each quarter.</p><p>Results are published in the open data portal.</p></div></section></main><footer class='b-footer' data-footer-v='1'><span>Open notice feed</span><span>maintenance 1</span></footer></body></html>